WEBVTT

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.630
He said, "Ms. Pierson, is this an F?"

00:04:31.263 --> 00:04:32.597
I said, "Yes."

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:33.863
(Laughter)

00:04:33.897 --> 00:04:37.063
He said, "Then why'd you
put a smiley face?"

00:04:37.063 --> 00:04:39.297
I said, "Because you're on a roll.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:42.197
You got two right.
You didn't miss them all."

00:04:42.197 --> 00:04:43.363
(Laughter)

00:04:43.397 --> 00:04:46.797
I said, "And when we review this,
won't you do better?"

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.330
He said, "Yes, ma'am, I can do better."

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.963
You see, "-18" sucks
all the life out of you.

00:04:52.963 --> 00:04:55.030
"+2" said, "I ain't all bad."